WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.850
A percentage is hundredths of the amount.

2
00:00:03.603 --> 00:00:06.428
Ten percent is a tenth: eight dollars.

3
00:00:07.055 --> 00:00:11.255
Fifteen percent is ten percent and five percent: twelve dollars.

4
00:00:14.983 --> 00:00:17.683
Or multiply by nought point one five.
